GOVERNANCE CODE
A significant proportion of the Supervisory 
Board’s work is conducted in committees.From among its members, Evotec’s Supervisory Board has established, pursuant to the German Stock 
Corporation Act and the recommendations of the Code, an Audit Committee as well as a 
Remuneration and Nomination Committee.Members of both committees are appointed in accordance with the Code.Evotec’s Audit Committee, comprising three members, supports the Supervisory Board in independently monitoring the Company’s financial reporting activities and in auditing reports.In particular, the Audit Committee scrutinises the Company’s accounting processes, the effectiveness of the internal control system and the audit.In addition, it discusses the quarterly and half-year reports with the 
Management Board.

